# What `docker build` never sends to the image's build (Dockerfile, E00-T07a).

# Settings and secrets, at any depth: the image is built without them and holds none. Every setting
# comes from the environment the image runs in. `.env.example` too: the image never reads it.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# The front desk's session that the end-to-end checks share, and test and tool output.
tests/e2e/.auth/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# What the build makes itself: the dependencies and the build output.
**/node_modules/
.next/
out/
next-env.d.ts

# What no stage needs: history, planning, the design reference, editor and agent settings.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
docs/
design/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
